        },
        {
          "text": "“Mundu uyalwa kigira vulumindi anyala kuva mwiti, uyu anyala kwitwa niiva kulava na valoli vaviri anoho vanyingi. Vololi vwu mundu mulala sivunyala kudinyiriza liyaaliza liu mulumindi mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaduukanaa mulumindi yiitwi. Sianyala kohononoka ku maduywa yaga kulwukutunga mabese mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva mundu yirukira mu lidaala linene, mutamuleki atungi mabese gu kumukola yirane yengo musaalisi munene nagikiri kukuza mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva mukoraa yaga mulonogonyia kivala cha mumenyi mu. Vulumindi vwonogonyia kivala, nihataveeyeho nelikuza liu mulumindi sihaveeye ho ninzira yindi yokokola mwima gwu kutakasa kivala hu mundu amali kwitirwa mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutonogonyi kivala hamumenya mba kigira inzi ni Yahova na menyi hagati ha vandu va Isiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
